    "m_ObjectId": "a80b9836a4eb4cab9caf1ec74a513fde",
    "m_Title": "Animating a ball bouncing effect",
    "m_Content": "The absolute node in this case takes any negative/- values and turns them into a positive. The result of this is that as soon as a value goes below 0, it immediately flips into a positive creating a stopgap like effect",
